    <h2>Adventure</h2>
    <p>I love finding myself in "improbable places". Whether I'm 500-ft off the ground on a cliff ledge that only a handful of humans have ever stood on before, or in an off-the-beaten-path restaurant in a small town in a foreign country, these are the kinds of places and experiences that bring me joy.</p>
    <CountryMap {...MAP} />
    <div class="sub">
      <h3>Travel</h3>
      <p>I want to see and visit as much of the world as possible in this life. I'm no van-life nomad or jet-setting freelancer (at least not yet ;)). But hopefully this page is proof that you can hold down a full-time job in a home-base city and still get out there in the world.</p>
      <p>14 countries and counting!</p>
      <div class="reel" data-title="Travel"><div class="reel-track" aria-label="Travel photos"><img src="/adventure/travel-1.jpg" alt="Travel photo 1" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-2.jpg" alt="Travel photo 2" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-3.jpg" alt="Travel photo 3" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-4.jpg" alt="Travel photo 4" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-5.jpg" alt="Travel photo 5" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-6.jpg" alt="Travel photo 6" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-8.jpg" alt="Travel photo 7" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-9.jpg" alt="Travel photo 8" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-10.jpg" alt="Travel photo 9" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-11.jpg" alt="Travel photo 10" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-12.jpg" alt="Travel photo 11" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-13.jpg" alt="Travel photo 12" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/travel-14.jpg" alt="Travel photo 13" loading="lazy" /></div><button class="reel-prev" type="button" aria-label="Scroll photos left">&#8249;</button><button class="reel-next" type="button" aria-label="Scroll photos right">&#8250;</button></div>
