      <h3>Climbing &amp; mountaineering</h3>
      <p>Climbing has given me some of my favorite memories and adventures of my entire life. It's a great excuse to travel to parts of the world that others rarely visit, but which have a lot to offer the visitor. And there is no more improbable place than standing on a glaciated mountain summit or a tiny ledge halfway up a cliff.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.mountainproject.com/user/201008756/david-goodloe">Mountain Project &rarr;</a></p>
      <div class="reel" data-title="Climbing and mountaineering"><div class="reel-track" aria-label="Climbing and mountaineering photos"><img src="/adventure/climbing-1.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 1" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-2.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 2" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-3.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 3" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-5.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 4" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-6.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 5" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-7.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 6" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-8.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 7" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-9.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 8" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-10.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 9" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-11.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 10" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-12.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 11" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-13.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 12" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-14.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 13" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-15.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 14" loading="lazy" /><img src="/adventure/climbing-16.jpg" alt="Climbing and mountaineering photo 15" loading="lazy" /></div><button class="reel-prev" type="button" aria-label="Scroll photos left">&#8249;</button><button class="reel-next" type="button" aria-label="Scroll photos right">&#8250;</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sub">
      <h3>Snowboarding</h3>
      <p>I've often said that snowboarding is the most fun I've ever had on my own two feet. It's true, and if you've ever ridden, you know the feeling yourself. Living in the southeast US, I certainly don't get to snowboard as much as I get to do some of my other adventures, but we still make time for it. It's such an incredible way to move through mountainous terrain, even if the lift did the hard part for you (unless it didn't... see splitboarding!).</p>
