      <p>For the last 9 years, I've worked at Branch Technology. I'm currently the Director of our business unit focused on digitally-manufactured energy retrofits, and I've also cut my teeth on federally funded research and technology projects across many domains. I love building technology businesses, exploring product-market-fit, and being on a team pursuing a common goal. If you'd like to check out my resume, too, it's available <a href="/david-goodloe-resume.pdf">here</a>.</p>
